{"data":{"type":"template","attributes":{"name":"[DRAFT DnD] SOL KYST | Welcome 3 - Founder story + reviews","editor_type":"SYSTEM_DRAGGABLE","definition":{"body":{"properties":{},"styles":{"background_color":"#FAF9F6","width":600},"sections":[{"content_type":"section","type":"section","data":{"properties":{},"display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"background_color":"#3B2C27","inner_padding_top":11,"inner_padding_right":16,"inner_padding_bottom":11,"inner_padding_left":16,"stack_on_mobile":true}},"rows":[{"data":{"styles":{"column_layout":"1-column-full-width"}},"columns":[{"blocks":[{"content_type":"block","type":"text","data":{"content":"<p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0\"><a href=\"https://www.solkyst.ca/discount/kystfortheveryfirsttime\" style=\"color:#FAF9F6;text-decoration:none\">15% off your first pair &middot; tap to apply</a></p>","display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"block_padding_top":0,"block_padding_right":0,"block_padding_bottom":0,"block_padding_left":0}}}]}]}]},{"content_type":"section","type":"section","data":{"properties":{},"display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"background_color":"#FAF9F6","inner_padding_top":24,"inner_padding_right":20,"inner_padding_bottom":20,"inner_padding_left":20,"stack_on_mobile":true}},"rows":[{"data":{"styles":{"column_layout":"1-column-full-width"}},"columns":[{"blocks":[{"content_type":"block","type":"text","data":{"content":"<p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:8px;margin:0\"><a href=\"https://www.solkyst.ca\" style=\"color:#1E1512;text-decoration:none\">SOL KYST</a></p>","display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"block_padding_top":0,"block_padding_right":0,"block_padding_bottom":0,"block_padding_left":0}}}]}]}]},{"content_type":"section","type":"section","data":{"properties":{},"display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"background_color":"#FAF9F6","inner_padding_top":0,"inner_padding_right":0,"inner_padding_bottom":0,"inner_padding_left":0,"stack_on_mobile":true}},"rows":[{"data":{"styles":{"column_layout":"1-column-full-width"}},"columns":[{"blocks":[{"content_type":"block","type":"image","data":{"properties":{"dynamic":false,"asset_id":"384349174","src":"https://cdn.klaviyomail.com/company/Yh6N8Y/images/32fb9d73-3398-443d-b274-ec2a6ed536f0.jpeg","href":"https://www.solkyst.ca/discount/kystfortheveryfirsttime?redirect=/pages/about","alt_text":"SOL KYST"},"display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"align":"center","full_width_mobile":true,"block_padding_top":0,"block_padding_right":0,"block_padding_bottom":0,"block_padding_left":0}}}]}]}]},{"content_type":"section","type":"section","data":{"properties":{},"display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"background_color":"#FAF9F6","inner_padding_top":40,"inner_padding_right":48,"inner_padding_bottom":12,"inner_padding_left":48,"stack_on_mobile":true}},"rows":[{"data":{"styles":{"column_layout":"1-column-full-width"}},"columns":[{"blocks":[{"content_type":"block","type":"text","data":{"content":"<p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B6460;margin:0 0 14px\">A note from Meghan</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-style:italic;font-size:34px;line-height:1.15;color:#1E1512;margin:0 0 6px\">The pair I<br>couldn&#39;t find.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;margin:0 0 16px\">Hi, it&#39;s Meghan, the founder of SOL KYST. Let me take you back to summer 2020.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;margin:0 0 16px\">It&#39;s lockdown. Work is shut down, I&#39;m living in downtown Toronto, eating through my savings and wondering what the heck I&#39;m going to do. One day I&#39;m sitting on the beach with my friend, in my cute cover-up and my bathing suit&hellip; and a stupid pair of sunglasses that made me look like John Lennon and Harry Potter had a baby.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;margin:0 0 16px\">And at some point I realized I hadn&#39;t really been listening to her. I was in a full shame spiral about how I looked, and then feeling even worse about that, like, why don&#39;t I care about my friend right now?</p><p style=\"text-align:center;margin:0 0 16px\">You know that feeling. When something&#39;s off with your outfit or you&#39;re feeling insecure, your whole mood is off and you can&#39;t enjoy the spaces you&#39;re in. And realistically? All I needed was a pair of glasses that actually fit me.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;margin:0 0 16px\">They weren&#39;t even abnormally small. I&#39;m just a wide-faced cheeky babe, and sunglasses come in one standard size that has never worked for me.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;margin:0 0 16px\">And right there, the idea washed up on shore: <b>I&#39;m going to make the widest, largest women&#39;s sunglasses on the market.</b></p><p style=\"text-align:center;margin:0 0 16px\">I&#39;d been a makeup artist for 10+ years, so I sat in front of my mirror with construction paper and scissors and used highlight and contour to cut out a shape that actually flatters a wider face. Many, many paper cut-outs later (and a terrible Canva diagram), that became our Kyst Eye. Same design we use today.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;margin:0 0 16px\">In March 2021 I showed the first black prototype on TikTok, not expecting anything. 120,000 views in a few days and 1,200 sign-ups over one weekend. I threw a website together in three days and had a <b>$10,000+ launch day</b>. Exciting, amazing and really freaking scary, because the inventory was three months away.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;margin:0 0 16px\">Now we&#39;re in three sizes (<b>Mini 135, Midi 145 and Wide 158mm</b>), with 650+ five-star reviews and customers in over 50 countries. And on CBC&#39;s Dragons&#39; Den, two Dragons wanted to partner with us.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;margin:0 0 16px\">Because let&#39;s be real: a bomb pair of sunnies is your armour for the day. You deserve one that fits.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-style:italic;font-size:18px;color:#1E1512;margin:8px 0 2px\">Love, Meghan</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B6460;margin:0 0 16px\">Founder, SOL KYST</p>","display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"block_padding_top":0,"block_padding_right":0,"block_padding_bottom":0,"block_padding_left":0}}},{"content_type":"block","type":"button","data":{"content":"Watch our episode","properties":{"href":"https://www.cbc.ca/dragonsden/pitches/sol-kyst"},"display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"background_color":"transparent","color":"#3B2C27","border_color":"#3B2C27","border_style":"solid","border_width":2,"border_radius":0,"font_family":"'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif","font_size":13,"font_weight":"600","letter_spacing":2,"text_align":"center","inner_padding_top":14,"inner_padding_bottom":14,"inner_padding_left":34,"inner_padding_right":34,"block_padding_top":10,"block_padding_right":0,"block_padding_bottom":10,"block_padding_left":0}}},{"content_type":"block","type":"text","data":{"content":"<p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:8px 0 0\"><a href=\"https://www.solkyst.ca/pages/about\" style=\"color:#3B2C27\">Read the full story &rarr;</a></p>","display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"block_padding_top":0,"block_padding_right":0,"block_padding_bottom":0,"block_padding_left":0}}}]}]}]},{"content_type":"section","type":"section","data":{"properties":{},"display_op