sses looked slightly off, but I just needed wider sunglasses!&rdquo;</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B6460;margin:0 0 26px\">Mary H. &middot; Monarch</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#3B2C27;margin:0 0 8px\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-style:italic;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#1E1512;margin:0 0 10px\">&ldquo;With my very wide face, even the widest frames looked incredibly awkward and dorky. Enter the MONARCH!!&rdquo;</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B6460;margin:0 0 26px\">Midori P. &middot; Monarch</p>","display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"block_padding_top":0,"block_padding_right":0,"block_padding_bottom":0,"block_padding_left":0}}},{"content_type":"block","type":"button","data":{"content":"Find my pair","properties":{"href":"https://www.solkyst.ca/discount/kystfortheveryfirsttime?redirect=/collections/all"},"display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"background_color":"transparent","color":"#3B2C27","border_color":"#3B2C27","border_style":"solid","border_width":2,"border_radius":0,"font_family":"'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif","font_size":13,"font_weight":"600","letter_spacing":2,"text_align":"center","inner_padding_top":14,"inner_padding_bottom":14,"inner_padding_left":34,"inner_padding_right":34,"block_padding_top":10,"block_padding_right":0,"block_padding_bottom":10,"block_padding_left":0}}}]}]}]},{"content_type":"section","type":"section","data":{"properties":{},"display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"background_color":"#FAF9F6","inner_padding_top":40